            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Noun: A word that fits this frame: The [ ] is good. Some are concrete: dog, rock, car; others are abstract: ambition, space, speed. The nouns that most concern us are nominalizations, nouns derived from verbs or adjectives: act → action, wide → width.",
